{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A crisscrossing mahjong grid</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1, 2, 3 dot make a sequence, and 3, 4, 5 dot make a sequence. Wouldn't it be nice to reuse the 3 dot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/ee1adef40ce8a47826937dc8e134c900.poster.avif?t=1774672416\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/ee1adef40ce8a47826937dc8e134c900.webm?t=1774672416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forging faans for huge winning hands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Matrix Mahjong</i>, flexibly arrange your tiles on the 3x7 table to achieve HU (a winning hand) in diverse ways, and multiply your earnings with a variety of FAAN (scoring rules).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/638303c54a74e0acc313aabbbe181b70.poster.avif?t=1774672416\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/638303c54a74e0acc313aabbbe181b70.webm?t=1774672416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/638303c54a74e0acc313aabbbe181b70.mp4?t=1774672416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-craft pixel-art mahjong tiles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The famous faan &quot;All Honors&quot; is defined as &quot;a hand consisting only of honor tiles&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In normal mahjong, this implicitly requires 4 triplets + 1 pair of honor tiles, or 7 pairs of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in Matrix Mahjong, with the help of various item, there are much easier and diverse way for it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/bf7bc3ce886178c4a380fc1b54342376.poster.avif?t=1774672416\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/bf7bc3ce886178c4a380fc1b54342376.webm?t=1774672416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/bf7bc3ce886178c4a380fc1b54342376.mp4?t=1774672416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-craft pixel-art mahjong tiles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisite voxel mahjong and smooth drag-and-drop interaction create an immersive tile-building experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/d191d9627f2b0ddc84c30e0c7312cad3.poster.avif?t=1774672416\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/d191d9627f2b0ddc84c30e0c7312cad3.webm?t=1774672416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/extras/d191d9627f2b0ddc84c30e0c7312cad3.mp4?t=1774672416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967760?t=1774672416","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/578fafb36f157624c9c5f6f8c0e45d61b8018479/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774672416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967760/f854d43c7428492138f642f798be3facfe1372a1/